        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Nada Surf, Shihad\n- Albums: The Stars Are Indifferent to Astronomy, The General Electric\n- People: Matthew Caws, Ira Elliot, Doug Gillard, Daniel Lorca\n- Places: New Zealand\n- Topics: alternative rock, rock\n\nFacts:\n- Shihad are a rock band from New Zealand that formed in 1988.\n- The General Electric is the fourth album by Shihad, and it was released in October 1999.\n- Nada Surf is an American alternative rock band.\n- Nada Surf currently consists of Matthew Caws, Ira Elliot, Doug Gillard, and Daniel Lorca.\n- Matthew Caws plays guitar and provides vocals in Nada Surf.\n- Ira Elliot is the drummer for Nada Surf.\n- Doug Gillard plays guitar in Nada Surf.\n- Daniel Lorca plays bass and provides backing vocals in Nada Surf.\n- The Stars Are Indifferent to Astronomy is the sixth album by Nada Surf.",
